  m_Name: 5 Fix the broken circuit
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ARCircuitsLab.Tasks.TaskData
  title: Fix the broken circuit
  goal: This circuit should work, but the bulb stays dark. Find the fault and fix
    it.
  hint: Tap a part to check it. Press and hold a broken part to remove it, then wire
    in a new one.
  goalType: 4
  points: 100
  parts:
  - Ready-made circuit
  - 1 new bulb
  - 2 wires
  learn: One broken part can stop current in the whole loop.
  successTitle: You fixed it!
  explanation: The old bulb was broken, so it blocked the loop like an open switch.
    With a new bulb, {0:0.00} A flows again.
